    "text": "📍Aroma Warschauer Str.\n\nSave this place and other recommendations I post on the @miotravelapp so they are all in the same place!!\n\n#berlin #berlinfood #berlinguide #berlinfoodie #cheapeats ",
    "subtitles": "This is one of my new favourite restaurants in Berlin.\nIt's Cantonese Chinese food.\nIt is so nostalgic to me. Growing up in Sydney,\nI had that soup so much as a child.\nI'm obsessed with these rice noodle dim sum.\nThey have a range of small dishes,\nincluding Peking duck,\nwhich I will be getting next time, that you can share with a partner.\nThey have a bunch of really amazing mains.\nThe prices are great. But do get in early if you go on a weekend\nor I think you can make a phone reservation.\nIt gets super busy on a Saturday.\nWe waited a while, but luckily we got in and I will be going back!!",
